    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 8,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "Rightly or wrongly, for better or worse, the counselors defined themselves quickly. No one more so than Wendy. First week of camp, the perky girl who knows all the rules and all the songs is pretty much Queen."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 3,
        "line": 440,
        "text": "Now stop pretending you didn't have any good times...Shooting stars. Frogs down pants. Surely, at some point, one of us watched a baby deer being born. Come on...Smi-ile."
      }
